@MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress = http://localhost:5184

# ==============================================================================
# AUTHENTICATION
# ==============================================================================

### 1. Register new user
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

### 2. Login with credentials
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 3. Initiate OIDC Login
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login-oidc?returnUrl=/dashboard

### 4. OIDC Callback (handled by middleware)
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signin-oidc?returnUrl=/dashboard

### 5. Logout
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

### 6. Get Current User Info
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 7. Signout Callback
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signout-callback-oidc
